ate="no"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line">client <span class="lk">=</span> anthropic.Anthropic()</span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line">message <span class="lk">=</span> client.messages.create(</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lj dc">    model</span><span class="lk">=</span><span class="l3 dn">"claude-opus-5-5"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lj dc">    max_tokens</span><span class="lk">=</span><span class="l1 di">1024</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lj dc">    system</span><span class="lk">=</span><span class="l3 dn">"You are a helpful coding assistant specializing in Python."</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lj dc">    messages</span><span class="lk">=</span>[</span>
<span class="line">        {<span class="l3 dn">"role"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"user"</span>, <span class="l3 dn">"content"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"How do I sort a list of dictionaries by key?"</span>}</span>
<span class="line">    ],</span>
<span class="line">)</span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span class="l1 dt">print</span>(message.content)</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div>
<h3 id="long-context-prompting" class="group">Long context prompting<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Long context prompting" id="_R_18ffcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<p>When working with large documents or data-rich inputs (20k+ tokens), structure your prompt carefully to get the best results:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Put long-form data at the top:</strong> Place your long documents and inputs near the top of your prompt, above your query, instructions, and examples. This improves performance across all models.</p>
<aside data-cds="Aside" data-prose-box="" data-icon-layout="first-line" role="note" class="flex items-start gap-xs rounded-card px-lg py-md font-sans text-body font-normal break-words bg-surface-1 layers-1-[color:var(--cds-banner-neutral-tint)] text-primary shadow-[inset_0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-inner)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color)),0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-outer)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color))] [--cds-prose-code-color:initial] [--cds-prose-marker-color:var(--cds-text-secondary)] [--cds-text-link-color:initial] prose-block print:break-inside-avoid print:[:is(h2,h3,h4)+&amp;]:break-after-avoid"><span class="flex min-h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1">Queries at the end can improve response quality by up to 30 percent in tests, especially with complex, multidocument inputs.</div></aside>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Structure document content and metadata with XML tags:</strong> When using multiple documents, wrap each document in <code>&lt;document&gt;</code> tags with <code>&lt;document_content&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;source&gt;</code> (and other metadata) subtags for clarity.</p>
<div data-orientation="vertical" data-cds="Accordion" class="group/accordion font-sans divide-y prose-block" style="--accordion-px:var(--cds-pad-md);--accordion-radius:var(--cds-radius)"><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="group-hover/accordion:[&amp;:has(+*:not([data-disabled])&gt;[data-cds=AccordionHeader]:hover)]:border-b-transparent group-hover/accordion:[&amp;[data-closed]:not([data-disabled]):has(&gt;[data-cds=AccordionHeader]:hover)]:border-b-transparent touch:[&amp;:has(+*:not([data-disabled])&gt;[data-cds=AccordionHeader]:active)]:border-b-transparent touch:[&amp;[data-closed]:not([data-disabled]):has(&gt;[data-cds=AccordionHeader]:active)]:border-b-transparent"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" data-cds="AccordionHeader" class="flex mx-outset w-stretch" style="--cds-outset-x:var(--accordion-px)"><button type="button" data-value="" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_4ggfcqalubtabsknr5td9leailbH2_" data-size="lg" class="cds-reset group/acc flex w-full items-start gap-sm min-h-control rounded-[var(--accordion-radius)] px-[var(--accordion-px)] py-[calc((var(--cds-h-control)_-_1lh)_/_2)] font-sans text-start text-body font-medium font-control text-primary outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden hover:bg-fill-ghost-hover touch:active:bg-fill-ghost-hover focus-visible:bg-fill-ghost-hover focus-visible:[box-shadow:inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-fill-accent)] data-[disabled]:opacity-disabled data-[disabled]:pointer-events-none stacks:focus-visible:bg-fill-ghost-selected select-text"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 break-words">Example multidocument structure</span><span data-cds-accordion-caret="" class="flex h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.5rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3;font-variation-settings:&quot;opsz&quot; 24;width:0.8333333333333334em;height:0.8333333333333334em;contain:layout paint;pointer-events:none" class="transition-transform duration-fast motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90 page-rtl:rotate-90 text-muted group-data-[panel-open]/acc:rotate-0 group-data-[panel-open]/acc:page-rtl:rotate-0 stacks:not-in-[tr[data-dimmed]]:[--cds-text-muted:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-secondary)]" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" data-starting-style="" hidden="" id="base-ui-_R_4ggfcqalubtabsknr5td9leailbH1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_4ggfcqalubtabsknr5td9leailbH2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto" class="break-words h-[var(--cds-disclosure-panel-height)] transition-[height] duration-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none data-[starting-style]:h-0 data-[ending-style]:h-0 data-[starting-style]:[clip-path:inset(-8px_-100vw_0_-100vw)] data-[ending-style]:[clip-path:inset(-8px_-100vw_0_-100vw)] data-[animating]:[clip-path:inset(-8px_-100vw_0_-100vw)] data-[starting-style]:contain-layout data-[ending-style]:contain-layout data-[animating]:contain-layout text-body font-normal text-secondary [--cds-disclosure-panel-height:var(--accordion-panel-height)]"><div class="py-md"><div class="text-prose"><div data-copy-scope="" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border bg-surface-2 print:[p+&amp;]:break-before-avoid group relative prose-block [&amp;&gt;[data-not-prose]]:mt-0"><div data-not-prose="true" tabindex="0" class="relative h-full py-4 pl-4 text-code overflow-x-auto focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 print:overflow-visible"><div class="inline-block min-w-full pr-4 print:block" data-code-source="" translate="no"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line"><span class="d9">&lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">documents</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">  &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">document</span><span class="l1 dc"> index</span>=<span class="l3 dn">"1"</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">source</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span>annual_report_2023.pdf<span class="d9">&lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">source</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">document_content</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line">      {{ANNUAL_REPORT}}</span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">document_content</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">  &lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">document</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">  &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">document</span><span class="l1 dc"> index</span>=<span class="l3 dn">"2"</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">source</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span>competitor_analysis_q2.xlsx<span class="d9">&lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">source</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">document_content</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line">      {{COMPETITOR_ANALYSIS}}</span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">document_content</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">  &lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">document</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">&lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">documents</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line">Analyze the annual report and competitor analysis. Identify strategic advantages and recommend Q3 focus areas.</span></code></pre></div></div><div class="absolute top-3 right-3 print:hidden opacity-100 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 md:focus-within:opacity-100"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="sm" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] text-muted" aria-label="Copy code" id="_R_vsggfcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Ground responses in quotes:</strong> For long document tasks, ask Claude to quote relevant parts of the documents first before carrying out its task. This helps Claude focus on the relevant content and ignore the rest of the document.</p>
<div data-orientation="vertical" data-cds="Accordion" class="group/accordion font-sans divide-y prose-block" style="--accordion-px:var(--cds-pad-md);--accordion-radius:var(--cds-radius)"><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="group-hover/accordion:[&amp;:has(+*:not([data-disabled])&gt;[data-cds=AccordionHeader]:hover)]:border-b-transparent group-hover/accordion:[&amp;[data-closed]:not([data-disabled]):has(&gt;[data-cds=AccordionHeader]:hover)]:border-b-transparent touch:[&amp;:has(+*:not([data-disabled])&gt;[data-cds=AccordionHeader]:active)]:border-b-transparent touch:[&amp;[data-closed]:not([data-disabled]):has(&gt;[data-cds=AccordionHeader]:active)]:border-b-transparent"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" data-cds="AccordionHeader" class="flex mx-outset w-stretch" style="--cds-outset-x:var(--accordion-px)"><button type="button" data-value="" data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_4ogfcqalubtabsknr5td9leailbH2_" data-size="lg" class="cds-reset group/acc flex w-full items-start gap-sm min-h-control rounded-[var(--accordion-radius)] px-[var(--accordion-px)] py-[calc((var(--cds-h-control)_-_1lh)_/_2)] font-sans text-start text-body font-medium font-control text-primary outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden hover:bg-fill-ghost-hover touch:active:bg-fill-ghost-hover focus-visible:bg-fill-ghost-hover focus-visible:[box-shadow:inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-fill-accent)] data-[disabled]:opacity-disabled data-[disabled]:pointer-events-none stacks:focus-visible:bg-fill-ghost-selected select-text"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 break-words">Example quote extraction</span><span data-cds-accordion-caret="" class="flex h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.5rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3;font-variation-settings:&quot;opsz&quot; 24;width:0.8333333333333334em;height:0.8333333333333334em;contain:layout paint;pointer-events:none" class="transition-transform duration-fast motion-reduce:transition-none -rotate-90 page-rtl:rotate-90 text-muted group-data-[panel-open]/acc:rotate-0 group-data-[panel-open]/acc:page-rtl:rotate-0 stacks:not-in-[tr[data-dimmed]]:[--cds-text-muted:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-secondary)]" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-hidden="" data-index="-1" data-closed="" data-starting-style="" hidden="" id="base-ui-_R_4ogfcqalubtabsknr5td9leailbH1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_4ogfcqalubtabsknr5td9leailbH2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto" class="break-words h-[var(--cds-disclosure-panel-height)] transition-[height] duration-base ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none data-[starting-style]:h-0 data-[ending-style]:h-0 data-[starting-style]:[clip-path:inset(-8px_-100vw_0_-100vw)] data-[ending-style]:[clip-path:inset(-8px_-100vw_0_-100vw)] data-[animating]:[clip-path:inset(-8px_-100vw_0_-100vw)] data-[starting-style]:contain-layout data-[ending-style]:contain-layout data-[animating]:contain-layout text-body font-normal text-secondary [--cds-disclosure-panel-height:var(--accordion-panel-height)]"><div class="py-md"><div class="text-prose"><div data-copy-scope="" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border bg-surface-2 print:[p+&amp;]:break-before-avoid group relative prose-block [&amp;&gt;[data-not-prose]]:mt-0"><div data-not-prose="true" tabindex="0" class="relative h-full py-4 pl-4 text-code overflow-x-auto focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 print:overflow-visible"><div class="inline-block min-w-full pr-4 print:block" data-code-source="" translate="no"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line">You are an AI physician's assistant. Your task is to help doctors diagnose possible patient illnesses.</span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">&lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">documents</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">  &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">document</span><span class="l1 dc"> index</span>=<span class="l3 dn">"1"</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">source</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span>patient_symptoms.txt<span class="d9">&lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">source</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">document_content</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line">      {{PATIENT_SYMPTOMS}}</span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">document_content</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">  &lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">document</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">  &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">document</span><span class="l1 dc"> index</span>=<span class="l3 dn">"2"</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">source</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span>patient_records.txt<span class="d9">&lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">source</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">document_content</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line">      {{PATIENT_RECORDS}}</span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">document_content</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">  &lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">document</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">  &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">document</span><span class="l1 dc"> index</span>=<span class="l3 dn">"3"</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">source</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span>patient01_appt_history.txt<span class="d9">&lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">source</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">document_content</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line">      {{PATIENT01_APPOINTMENT_HISTORY}}</span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">    &lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">document_content</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">  &lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">document</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="d9">&lt;/</span><span class="l5 d4">documents</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line">Find quotes from the patient records and appointment history that are relevant to diagnosing the patient's reported symptoms. Place these in <span class="d9">&lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">quotes</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span> tags. Then, based on these quotes, list all information that would help the doctor diagnose the patient's symptoms. Place your diagnostic information in <span class="d9">&lt;</span><span class="l5 d4">info</span><span class="d9">&gt;</span> tags.</span></code></pre></div></div><div class="absolute top-3 right-3 print:hidden opacity-100 md:opacity-0 md:group-hover:opacity-100 md:focus-within:opacity-100"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="sm" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] text-muted" aria-label="Copy code" id="_R_vsogfcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inse